Z||000002||88formula||03-10-2000||05:00 PM||||No stock fiero will ever push you up against the firewall. They only have average sports car acceleration (0-60 in about 8 seconds and the 1/4 in 16 seconds). If you want that kind of acceleration than put a v8 in it or a supercharged Buick 3.8 V6 in it, or get nitrous.||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||03-10-2000||06:54 PM||||88, Huh?<P>My 87SC with 4 cyl may not pin you back but you will definatly feel it launch. If you catch a pasenger off gurad then they are very likely to bonk their head.<P>wxxo you didn't say what was suposed to be fixed. even then it might not be 100% right. At the very least get someone with a timing light to confirm the curb timing. If that's off then you'll definatly have performance problems.||||reg||1
